   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "READ ME",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "PromptForge H3 Endless Video\n\nFrom left to right:\n1. LOADER (left): pick your MiniMax H3 model, text encoder and VAEs. The LoRA loader and the sigma shift follow it. The 'Prompt writer' node is the language model that writes every part's prompt.\n2. WHAT: 'Story' holds all prompting: the general prompt and one box per part (press + / - for the number of parts). 'References' holds the characters (pictures + descriptions).\n3. HOW: 'Video Format' (size, seconds per part), 'Continuity' (how parts join), 'Sampling' (first stage) and 'Second Stage (upscale)'. Disconnect the Second Stage node for single-stage parts. Optional extras you can add: 'Live Preview', 'Speed and Memory'.\n4. The generator only generates: its frames and audio go into 'Save Video' (or any other node).\n\nA turbo LoRA wants 6-8 steps and cfg 1."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "PromptForge H3 Endless Video\n\nFrom left to right:\n1. LOADER (left): pick your MiniMax H3 model, text encoder and VAEs. The LoRA loader and the sigma shift follow it. The 'Prompt writer' node is the language model that writes every part's prompt.\n2. WHAT: 'Story' holds all prompting: the general prompt and one box per part (press + / - for the number of parts). 'References' holds the characters (pictures + descriptions).\n3. HOW: 'Video Format' (size, seconds per part), 'Continuity' (how parts join), 'Sampling' (first stage) and 'Second Stage (upscale)'. Disconnect the Second Stage node for single-stage parts. Optional extras you can add: 'Live Preview', 'Speed and Memory'.\n4. The generator only generates: its frames and audio go into 'Save Video' (or any other node).\n\nA turbo LoRA wants 6-8 steps and cfg 1."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
